TITLE Ca speciation with minerals and gas phase
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
    Aragonite 0 0

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 25
    CO2(g) 1
    CH4(g) 5
    H2S(g) 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -molalities Ca+2 CaOH+ CaHCO3+ CaCO3 CaSO4 CaHS+ CaH2S+ CaS CaCl+ CaF+ CaHPO4 CaH2PO4+ CaNO3+ CaO Ca(OH)2
END
